NineSQL – third-party licenses
==============================

The ninesql binary links the Rust crates listed below. Each section is one license text, as
shipped by the crates listed under it (a license appears once per distinct text). Some crates
compile in more than their own code: freetype-sys builds the bundled FreeType library (its version is in the SBOM)
(taken under the FreeType License, FTL) and gpui-kit-assets embeds the Lucide icons (ISC, and
MIT for the Feather-derived ones); their sections carry those texts too. NineSQL
itself is under the Apache License 2.0 (/usr/share/doc/ninesql/copyright); the bundled SQLite
and other notices are in /usr/share/doc/ninesql/NOTICE.
